        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>On the Control Plane, change to the /etc/kubernetes/manifest directory. Run the command:
chown root:root *

To verify the change took place, run the command:
ls -l *

All the manifest files should be owned by root:root.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
