        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>On the Control Plane, run the command:
ps -ef | grep kubelet

Remove the "client-ca-file" option.

Note the path to the config file (identified by --config).

Run the command:
grep -i clientCAFile &lt;path_to_config_file&gt;

Note the path to the client ca file.

Run the command:
chown root:root &lt;path_to_client_ca_file&gt;</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
        </STIG_DATA>
